WEBVTT

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:46.230
Run!

00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:49.770
Morning.

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.400
Morning!

00:00:52.110 --> 00:00:53.570
Nagi-chan, Yuuko-chan!

00:00:53.570 --> 00:00:54.490
Good morning!

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:57.490
What're you doing standing there?

00:00:57.950 --> 00:00:59.490
Hey, look at this!

00:00:59.490 --> 00:01:01.410
It was stuck to my forehead!

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:03.330
You just noticed?

00:01:03.710 --> 00:01:04.290
Yep!

00:01:04.290 --> 00:01:06.580
Same old Run, huh?

00:01:07.380 --> 00:01:08.460
Really?

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:09.290
Run-chan.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:10.300
Morning.

00:01:10.300 --> 00:01:11.090
Morning!

00:01:11.090 --> 00:01:12.420
Ruuun-chan!

00:01:12.420 --> 00:01:13.260
Morning!

00:01:13.260 --> 00:01:15.220
Hey, hey, did you see that drama yesterday?

00:01:15.220 --> 00:01:15.470
Yeah, I did!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:16.590
Run sure has lots of male friends.

00:01:16.590 --> 00:01:17.720
It was great!

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:17.930
Then what about that anime yesterday...

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:19.050
She sure does...

00:01:38.410 --> 00:01:39.570
T-Tooru!

00:01:40.330 --> 00:01:42.200
Hard at work this morning, I see.

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:44.500
What's wrong, Tooru?

00:01:48.750 --> 00:01:50.000
Run-chan.

00:03:27.930 --> 00:03:29.560
Morning, Tooru.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.730
I see you're small as usual today.

00:03:32.650 --> 00:03:34.060
Don't pat me!

00:03:36.020 --> 00:03:38.400
Whoa! Why are your clothes so dirty?

00:03:38.400 --> 00:03:39.280
Did you fall down?

00:03:40.780 --> 00:03:41.740
Run-chan was...

00:03:41.740 --> 00:03:42.990
And you see,

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:44.490
it wasn't on the map...

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:46.160
<i>Don't tell me Run was bullying her...</i>

00:03:50.250 --> 00:03:53.540
... chasing a butterfly, and a car was about to hit her.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.500
That's quite responsible of you.

00:04:02.430 --> 00:04:03.630
See you, Tooru.

00:04:04.760 --> 00:04:05.510
Later!

00:04:06.680 --> 00:04:09.220
See you at lunchtime, Tooru!

00:04:11.310 --> 00:04:12.310
Good morning!

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.090
Yes?

00:04:43.090 --> 00:04:44.800
Hello? Run-chan?

00:04:45.130 --> 00:04:47.430
Tooru! It's been a while!

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:48.300
Yeah.

00:04:48.810 --> 00:04:49.850
Umm...

00:04:49.850 --> 00:04:51.430
Can I come right now?

00:04:51.930 --> 00:04:53.980
Sure, come right on over!

00:04:54.560 --> 00:04:55.480
Thanks.

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:57.400
See you later then.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.240
<i>It's been a while, hasn't it?</i>

00:05:05.150 --> 00:05:08.660
<i>Because of exams and all, we haven't seen each other in a while.</i>

00:05:21.960 --> 00:05:22.670
Coming!

00:05:24.760 --> 00:05:26.430
Oh my, Tooru-chan!

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:28.010
It's been a while!

00:05:28.010 --> 00:05:29.300
It's good to see you again.

00:05:29.850 --> 00:05:31.390
Run's upstairs.

00:05:32.100 --> 00:05:32.600
Got it.

00:05:35.890 --> 00:05:37.020
Pardon the intrusion.

00:06:01.210 --> 00:06:03.920
<i>I wonder... if Run-chan will be happy.</i>

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:15.850
Run-chan!

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.650
I got into the same high school as you!

00:06:24.690 --> 00:06:26.440
Ah! Tooru!

00:06:34.990 --> 00:06:39.370
Wha-

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:51.590
Ouch!

00:06:51.590 --> 00:06:53.180
Run, what's with this girl?

00:06:53.180 --> 00:06:54.890
Run, who is she?

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:56.020
What was she just doing?

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.480
You got in?

00:06:57.480 --> 00:06:58.310
Congratulations!

00:06:58.730 --> 00:07:00.600
Never mind getting in!

00:07:00.600 --> 00:07:02.100
So this is Tooru?

00:07:02.730 --> 00:07:04.900
She really is tiny.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.980
So she's the one you wanted to introduce us to?

00:07:07.690 --> 00:07:08.900
Introduce?

00:07:08.900 --> 00:07:10.150
Yep, that's right!

00:07:10.660 --> 00:07:12.570
They were announcing the test results today,

00:07:12.570 --> 00:07:14.580
and I figured Tooru would stop by,

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:15.910
so I invited you two over!

00:07:16.540 --> 00:07:18.450
These are my friends from our school,

00:07:18.450 --> 00:07:20.750
Yuuko-chan and Nagi-chan!

00:07:21.120 --> 00:07:21.670
Nice to meetcha.

00:07:23.080 --> 00:07:24.170
Friends...?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:26.920
We'll be together starting spring, Tooru.

00:07:28.550 --> 00:07:30.970
I think she's giving me the death glare...

00:07:31.340 --> 00:07:34.180
Talk about a bad first impression, Yuuko.

00:07:34.180 --> 00:07:35.970
You should probably explain what you were doing.

00:07:41.560 --> 00:07:43.730
Um... looks like you misunderstood.

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.230
Run was tickling me just now.

00:07:46.730 --> 00:07:48.320
We weren't doing anything weird,

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:50.440
just fooling around.

00:07:50.950 --> 00:07:51.360
Huh?

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.960
Geez, what was that for?

00:08:11.420 --> 00:08:14.300
Looks like they've broken the ice. How nice!

00:08:14.300 --> 00:08:16.180
Shouldn't you stop her?

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.120
Well then...

00:08:37.120 --> 00:08:40.410
I'll be sending around the elective sign-up sheets.

00:08:40.790 --> 00:08:43.160
It's just like last year's, so you'll figure it out.

00:08:43.960 --> 00:08:44.290
Here.

00:08:59.140 --> 00:09:02.560
<i>Our homeroom teacher this year is pretty lax...</i>

00:09:04.230 --> 00:09:08.440
And that's the procedure for filling out your elective selection forms.

00:09:09.110 --> 00:09:11.820
Does anybody have any questions?

00:09:12.360 --> 00:09:16.030
As first-years, you don't have many elective choices,

00:09:16.030 --> 00:09:18.240
but your options will increase in later semesters.

00:09:18.240 --> 00:09:20.910
This will affect your future,

00:09:20.910 --> 00:09:23.080
so please think carefully about your choices.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:27.000
If you have any individual questions, please ask at any time.

00:09:47.850 --> 00:09:49.980
<i>Will Run be okay?</i>

00:10:13.250 --> 00:10:14.760
What is she doing?

00:10:22.010 --> 00:10:23.890
Lunch time, lunch time~

00:10:24.350 --> 00:10:26.350
Tooru, let's eat!

00:10:26.810 --> 00:10:28.440
You sure are hasty.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:29.980
Tooru's not here yet.

00:10:30.400 --> 00:10:32.900
Ah, you're right, it just slipped out.

00:10:34.650 --> 00:10:36.320
She's here, Nagi-chan!

00:10:36.320 --> 00:10:38.070
That's my Tooru!

00:10:38.400 --> 00:10:39.030
Don't tell me...

00:10:39.530 --> 00:10:41.070
she heard her?

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:54.460
Ah, that squirrel toothpick is so cute!

00:10:54.920 --> 00:10:57.590
Isn't it? It's my favorite!

00:10:57.590 --> 00:11:00.010
I love animals!

00:11:00.010 --> 00:11:03.680
Really? What's your favorite animal?

00:11:04.970 --> 00:11:05.760
Birds, I guess.

00:11:06.140 --> 00:11:08.140
Oh, like parakeets?

00:11:08.140 --> 00:11:09.690
How cute.

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.100
Come to think of it,

00:11:16.360 --> 00:11:17.740
Run, your hair...

00:11:17.740 --> 00:11:18.860
looks sorta like a parakeet's.

00:11:19.700 --> 00:11:21.490
But most of all, they taste so good!

00:11:21.610 --> 00:11:22.070
What?

00:11:22.070 --> 00:11:23.200
Eh? That's why?

00:11:23.450 --> 00:11:25.780
Those poor parakeets, being eaten like that...

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:26.290
Huh?

00:11:26.290 --> 00:11:27.700
That's not what she meant!

00:11:31.670 --> 00:11:32.670
Run-chan...

00:11:32.670 --> 00:11:33.830
always liked to eat chicken.

00:11:34.290 --> 00:11:35.590
Oh, that's what you meant.

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:38.050
So your favorite food is a kind of bird.

00:11:38.050 --> 00:11:41.180
That's right! But I like all kinds of meat.

00:11:41.590 --> 00:11:43.300
Then why don't we go for Korean barbecue sometime?

00:11:46.430 --> 00:11:48.770
I'd love to have some some grilled ribs and beef tongue.

00:11:49.140 --> 00:11:52.440
This is really making me crave some Korean barbecue.

00:11:52.440 --> 00:11:56.070
It's as if I can already hear the sizzling of barbecuing meat...

00:12:02.990 --> 00:12:04.280
Sorry, it's for me.

00:12:05.160 --> 00:12:06.030
That's your ringtone?!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:09.540
Run, your fried eggs look so good.

00:12:10.370 --> 00:12:11.540
Can I have a bite?

00:12:11.540 --> 00:12:12.370
Go ahead.

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:13.460
Here.

00:12:13.460 --> 00:12:14.380
Thanks.

00:12:18.670 --> 00:12:20.710
Ah, delicious!

00:12:21.220 --> 00:12:22.680
Run, did you make this-

00:12:33.560 --> 00:12:34.350
Not again!

00:12:34.810 --> 00:12:37.610
Those two sure get along well!

00:12:37.860 --> 00:12:40.150
That's getting along well?

00:12:42.110 --> 00:12:44.450
That was a good lunch, wasn't it, Tooru?

00:12:44.450 --> 00:12:44.950
Yeah.

00:12:49.870 --> 00:12:51.450
Run, where do you think you're going?

00:12:52.960 --> 00:12:55.080
Our classroom is this way.

00:12:55.080 --> 00:12:56.670
That's right!

00:12:56.670 --> 00:12:59.000
We just moved up grades, so I'm still in the habit...

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.130
Hurry up, Run.

00:13:00.130 --> 00:13:02.460
Tooru, if you don't hurry up, you'll be late, too.

00:13:02.970 --> 00:13:04.720
See you later then!

00:13:26.780 --> 00:13:28.780
Toooooruuu!

00:14:06.360 --> 00:14:09.110
Run, I see you stayed awake during the afternoon classes.

00:14:09.110 --> 00:14:11.370
Yep! I was fine all afternoon.

00:14:11.370 --> 00:14:14.410
Did almost falling out of the window wake you up?

00:14:14.410 --> 00:14:16.330
Honestly, you should be more careful.

00:14:16.330 --> 00:14:16.830
'Kay.

00:14:19.250 --> 00:14:21.290
For me, I'm sleepier in the afternoon.

00:14:21.290 --> 00:14:21.840
Oh right.

00:14:22.340 --> 00:14:24.300
Want some candy to wake you up?

00:14:24.800 --> 00:14:25.260
Here.

00:14:28.300 --> 00:14:29.220
Thanks.

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.180
Here.

00:14:37.180 --> 00:14:38.190
One for you too, Run.

00:14:38.520 --> 00:14:39.520
Thanks!

00:14:40.560 --> 00:14:41.860
That's the last one.

00:14:41.980 --> 00:14:43.270
Hm? Really...

00:14:44.150 --> 00:14:46.610
Then I'll save it for Tooru.

00:14:47.240 --> 00:14:49.070
But then you won't have any.

00:14:49.410 --> 00:14:51.620
No, we'll split it in half.

00:14:52.280 --> 00:14:54.240
Oh Run, you're so nice.

00:14:54.240 --> 00:14:57.040
How do you plan to split that candy in half?

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:03.210
Ah, that's right!

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:04.920
Here we go!

00:15:05.500 --> 00:15:07.460
I wonder if I can split it like this?

00:15:07.920 --> 00:15:09.340
Don't be reckless.

00:15:09.340 --> 00:15:12.390
It'd be silly if you got hurt over a piece of candy.

00:15:12.390 --> 00:15:13.600
I'll be fine!

00:15:17.470 --> 00:15:18.430
Is it working?

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.120
Oh no, it fell on the floor!

00:15:33.120 --> 00:15:34.830
See? I told you.

00:15:35.080 --> 00:15:37.790
I thought it'd work!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:48.670
Tooru!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:51.470
Thanks for waiting!

00:15:54.510 --> 00:15:55.760
Let's go home.

00:16:02.190 --> 00:16:03.690
What's wrong, Tooru?

00:16:05.060 --> 00:16:06.440
I smell candy.

00:16:13.200 --> 00:16:14.700
You smell like candy.

00:16:14.950 --> 00:16:16.780
Huh? You have more?

00:16:16.780 --> 00:16:17.830
Candy! Candy! Candy! Candy! Candy! Candy!

00:16:17.830 --> 00:16:18.700
Actually...

00:16:20.370 --> 00:16:22.250
I forgot to throw out the bag.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:25.750
That's amazing, Tooru!

00:16:25.750 --> 00:16:27.790
You could even smell the empty bag?

00:16:27.790 --> 00:16:30.380
It's 'cause Tooru loves sweet things.

00:16:30.760 --> 00:16:34.260
Sorry. We were eating them earlier, and we finished the bag.

00:16:34.640 --> 00:16:36.140
I'll bring more some other time.

00:16:36.140 --> 00:16:38.140
I want amber candy!

00:16:38.560 --> 00:16:41.680
Er, how about something a little less sweet...

00:16:42.140 --> 00:16:44.020
or with less calories...

00:16:44.020 --> 00:16:46.860
Eh? But the sweet ones taste better.

00:16:46.860 --> 00:16:49.110
I got it, I got it, tomorrow then.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:55.240
What did you two choose as your electives?

00:16:55.240 --> 00:16:56.450
As our what?

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.660
Kamate-sensei was talking about it.

00:16:59.030 --> 00:17:00.910
Run, were you asleep?

00:17:02.790 --> 00:17:05.250
Come to think of it, you were!

00:17:05.790 --> 00:17:08.040
Oh, so why'd you fall down, Yuuko?

00:17:08.540 --> 00:17:12.050
Run looked like she was going to fall over, so I tried to catch her,

00:17:12.050 --> 00:17:15.130
but then she straightened up and I lost my balance.

00:17:15.130 --> 00:17:16.260
Hey,
Really.

00:17:16.260 --> 00:17:19.180
Tooru, what did you put for your first-year electives?

00:17:22.310 --> 00:17:22.930
Tooru?

00:17:32.230 --> 00:17:33.320
Run-chan...

00:17:34.740 --> 00:17:36.950
I wish I could take the same classes as you.

00:17:38.700 --> 00:17:39.530
Together.

00:17:53.920 --> 00:17:55.050
Don't worry.

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.350
Nothing's changed between us.

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:07.310
Yeah.

00:18:16.990 --> 00:18:19.990
Oh, you're just too cute, Tooru.

00:18:19.990 --> 00:18:22.030
S-St-Stop it-

00:18:24.950 --> 00:18:26.080
Say, Tooru.

00:18:26.370 --> 00:18:28.500
Why don't we all go out for tea?

00:18:29.210 --> 00:18:30.210
Get off of me.

00:18:30.960 --> 00:18:33.710
No fair, Yuuko! Let me hug her too.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.010
So soft!

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:40.970
Wh-what's with you two?

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:43.180
Huh?

00:18:44.600 --> 00:18:45.680
Let's go,

00:18:45.680 --> 00:18:46.730
Tooru!

00:20:58.270 --> 00:20:59.570
You know,

00:21:00.110 --> 00:21:03.070
Run really does have a lot of male friends.

00:21:03.570 --> 00:21:05.110
Wonder what they're talking about?

00:21:06.530 --> 00:21:09.910
Tell us Yuuko-chan's three sizes, Run-chan!

00:21:10.410 --> 00:21:11.790
Keep this a secret!

00:21:11.790 --> 00:21:15.120
From the top, 88-56-87.

00:21:15.370 --> 00:21:17.380
Wow, that's amazing!

00:21:18.000 --> 00:21:19.170
... or something like that?

00:21:19.800 --> 00:21:22.380
W-w-why do you know my sizes, Nagi?

00:21:25.130 --> 00:21:27.180
Well, see you later then, Run-chan.

00:21:27.180 --> 00:21:28.140
Later!

00:21:28.140 --> 00:21:29.510
Uh, see you!

00:21:30.390 --> 00:21:31.140
Huh?

00:21:31.850 --> 00:21:34.140
Look at that. They all left.

00:21:40.360 --> 00:21:41.320
So that's why.

00:21:42.480 --> 00:21:43.900
Ah, Tooru!

00:21:45.240 --> 00:21:46.110
Run-chan.

00:21:49.990 --> 00:21:52.410
Hard at work every morning, huh, Tooru?

00:21:54.580 --> 00:21:55.080
Tooru,

00:21:55.910 --> 00:21:58.120
I brought the candy, just as promised.

00:21:59.710 --> 00:22:01.590
Let's eat it together later.

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:11.220
Why?

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:15.020
Those two really do get along well.

00:22:22.820 --> 00:22:23.980
They sure do.

00:23:57.700 --> 00:23:59.790
Speaking of candy, there are all sorts of them!

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:01.620
Drizzles, showers, and gloomy rain.

00:24:01.620 --> 00:24:03.540
You sure know some unusual stuff.

00:24:03.540 --> 00:24:05.540
So we're going to have a quiz, Miporin!

00:24:05.540 --> 00:24:06.170
On what?

00:24:06.170 --> 00:24:08.380
Who are we?

00:24:08.380 --> 00:24:11.130
But you just gave away my name.

00:24:11.130 --> 00:24:13.930
Oh my, Yutaka totally messed up this time!

00:24:14.340 --> 00:24:15.720
Next time on A-Channel!

00:24:15.720 --> 00:24:17.350
"On Rainy Days, a Bath"!

00:24:17.350 --> 00:24:20.930
Come to think of it, since we've talked so much, maybe we'll appear next week?
